<AstroObjectEntry xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Outer-Wilds-New-Horizons/new-horizons/main/NewHorizons/Schemas/shiplog_schema.xsd">
  <ID>GITM_GHOST</ID>
  <!--
    Entry ID prefixes drive how the log behaves; see ShipLogDialogueManager.
      GITM_GHOST_   Lami talking. Reading the card prints what she said and offers whatever comes next.
      GITM_CHOICE_  The player talking. Similar but as a reply the player picks.
      GITM_VISION_  A Nomai memory Lami reviews. The rumor is earned by watching the vision out in the world. Reading the card prints her review of it.
      GITM_FIND_    Somewhere the player has to go. Rumors are leads Lami hands out, but the explore facts are only ever revealed by the world itself.
    Follow-ups Lami offers in response to a world discovery are revealed by conditionalChecks in
    systems/SolarSystem.json, since reading a GITM_FIND_ card deliberately doesn't advance anything.
  -->
